pan><span class=\"o\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">repeat'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">all_goals</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"gr\">sorry</span>\n</code></pre></div>",
